{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Report propagated delivery failures as retrying, not terminal.** This catch always rethrows, so no `FAILED` output reaches the backend and the invocation is retried. Classifying ordinary output serialization/checkpoint failures as `FAILED` makes OTel end the deterministic Workflow span terminally and can produce conflicting terminal spans after retry. Emit `RETRYING` here, or return a failure output for failures intended to be terminal, and update the serialization-failure test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77G-_2","finding_digest":"ca8ab3c33065de085f23114b9747dfe1b27f89f25f0ee276cd44e25a7d278ba1","finding_id":"arf_v1_zkflhqzqmxpaqxzdcffzor674g","finding_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::finishinvocation::delivery-failure-terminal-status","identity_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::finishinvocation::delivery-failure-terminal-status","line":169,"observation_digest":"843ea5c9084f598f05e9e0ad4da2238e50d365138299b656e1d41ea05328d7c4","observation_id":"aro_v1_qq7klsiij5my6bpj4cwu3irdrz","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T23:03:29Z","review_id":"arr_v1_g2tfoh6kbvnkvax47rhzhadniu","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"c1a33104784831a87e5d1fd9cf4b37417db20919","reviewer":"codex","start_line":169,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_2rkjpxkrb7e75fkhboprpmdrpn"},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_jluahjku63hfbdlzfaoakjocgf","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T23:03:29Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
